  "body": "Far from an ordinary new build, 65 Awa Uru Road brings genuine personality to modern living. From the statement kitchen and sculptural lighting to the private outdoor spaces and elevated Orewa outlook, every part of this home feels carefully considered.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen is the visual centrepiece. Warm timber cabinetry, a large stone-topped island, feature display shelving and softly illuminated detailing create a refined yet welcoming space. A distinctive pendant light and textured splashback complete the design, while excellent storage ensures the kitchen works just as beautifully as it looks.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan dining and living area is light, comfortable and easy to enjoy, with a heat pump for year-round comfort. Sliding doors create two separate connections outdoors - one leading to a sunny entertaining deck and the other to a fenced lawn. Whether it is dinner outside, a quiet morning coffee or space for children and pets, the corner position gives you more room to make the most of outdoor living.\r\n\r\nA generous separate laundry includes a built-in tub, benchtop and storage, while the ground floor also features a guest toilet and intercom for added everyday convenience. Upstairs, three well-proportioned bedrooms provide a peaceful retreat from the main living areas. The master bedroom has its own beautifully finished ensuite, complemented by a stylish family bathroom. Contemporary tiling, warm timber vanities, illuminated mirrors and\r\nblack accents continue the home’s polished design.\r\n\r\nThe finishing touch is the wide picture window, perfectly positioned to frame the changing sky and elevated outlook across Orewa towards Rangitoto Island in the distance. It is not simply another window - it gives the home a view to remember.\r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love:\r\n\r\n•  Three bedrooms, two bathrooms and a guest toilet\r\n•  Brand-new home with distinctive design details\r\n•  Generous corner position\r\n•  Designer kitchen with a large stone-topped island\r\n•  Warm timber cabinetry, feature shelving and integrated lighting\r\n•  Open-plan kitchen, dining and living\r\n•  Sunny entertaining deck and fully fenced lawn\r\n•  Two separate indoor-outdoor connections\r\n•  Elevated outlook across Orewa towards Rangitoto Island\r\n•  Master bedroom with ensuite\r\n•  Beautifully tiled bathrooms with illuminated mirrors\r\n•  Generous separate laundry with a built-in tub, benchtop and storage\r\n•  Heat pump and intercom\r\n•  Low-maintenance landscaping\r\n\r\nViewing Directions:\r\n\r\nEnter 251 West Hoe Heights, Orewa into your GPS. Turn left at the roundabout, enter the development when you see the Strathmill sign and follow the directional signs to 65 Awa Uru Road.\r\n\r\nSet within Strathmill, Orewa’s growing new community, the home is conveniently located for Orewa Beach, shops, cafés, schools and motorway access. Contact us today to arrange your viewing.",
